0.01 2026-05-27
    - added the first packaged `preview` skill with `dashboard preview.files`
      to bind the current local directory into a DD browser file-preview page
    - added a bookmark-backed browser surface with Ajax directory browsing and
      inline previews for text, images, pdf, audio, and video files
    - added Docker-verified Perl and Playwright tests plus skill-local
      governance, usage, and release documentation
    - fixed the installed Ajax worker bootstrap so `/app/preview` resolves
      `Preview::Directory` and `Preview::State` from the skill's own `lib/`
      path after a normal `dashboard skills install`
